    },
    {
      "title": "0.7.0.7 Update Note",
      "date": "2024-11-21 22:44:39",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1783872412001740",
      "content": "1.Added the ground display effect when the weather changes to rain and snow.\n2.New workbench stone mill, which can grind items.\n3.The new cash crop, sugarcane, can be used to produce sugar using stone mills. The molasses, a byproduct obtained randomly during the sugar-making process, can be used to make rum in fermentation barrels.\n3.Temporarily removed the windmill, now requires the use of a stone mill to produce flour.\n4.The new workbench fermentation barrel can use a container to add water and put in molasses for fermentation. After fermentation is complete, rum can be produced."
    },
